### Topic 29 - Configuration Properties & Profiles
### Start the app first: mvn spring-boot:run   (dev profile -> port 8080)
### With the prod profile the port is 8081 - change @port below.

@port = 8080

### 1. Values read with @Value
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/config/welcome

### 2. The type-safe ShopProperties record as JSON
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/config/shop

### 3. Which profile is active?
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/config/profile

### 4. Was the PAYMENT_API_KEY environment variable picked up? (masked)
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/config/secret
